      "text": "10 MIXER audio/engine.rs\nMake 5 ms chunks. 240 frames.\nMix voices. Fade old voices out.\n2.5 ms in. 5 ms out.\nAdd loop. Add master gain.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
